# The generated artifacts are BUILD PRODUCTS: never hand-written, never
# hand-copied, always written by scripts/build.sh (t27c gen-js plus the
# emitter). They ARE committed, because the plugin is installed from this
# repository as a git dependency and a git install must work on a machine
# that has no t27c toolchain. Rebuild them with `sh scripts/build.sh` and
# commit the result; a stale artifact fails test/gateway_ui.test.mjs.
